{"id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-one-reduction.md","title":"一一可约与归约等价","display":"df-one-reduction — 一一可约与归约等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-one-reduction","aliases":["20-df-one-reduction"],"display":"df-one-reduction — 一一可约与归约等价","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 1.6.8(ii)–1.6.9","source_pdf_pages":[50,51],"source_printed_pages":[14,15],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-one-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-one-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-one-reduction — 一一可约与归约等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 1.6.8(ii)–1.6.9"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span><span>51</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span><span>15</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{m,1\\}\">\\(r\\in\\{m,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\forall x,y\\ (f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)],\\\\\nA\\equiv_rB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_rB\\land B\\le_rA.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\forall x,y\\ (f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)],\\\\\nA\\equiv_rB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_rB\\land B\\le_rA.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一一归约与多一归约是集合之间的关系，函数值只负责从实例到实例的变换。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 1.6.8(ii)–1.6.9；印刷页 14, 15；PDF 第 50, 51 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\{m,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}one\\text{-}reduction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\le_1B\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\forall x,y\\ (f(x)=f(y)\\Rightarrow x=y)\\land\\forall x\\ (x\\in A\\Longleftrightarrow f(x)\\in B)],\\\\\nA\\equiv_rB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ A\\le_rB\\land B\\le_rA.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"4829719bf9cdd6dd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"2a1bca4da285ab7f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"29ee7a5caab12d22","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：